--- a/docs/business-rules.md
+++ b/docs/business-rules.md
@@ -62,8 +62,10 @@ ## User Administration
 | Edit account | Admin, owner (own entity) | Profile data and preferences; respect plan limits. |
 | Reset password | Admin, owner | Reset flow for **account** (login) and **user** (entity member), per security policy. |
 | Remove account | Admin, owner | Not applicable to owner while being owner. |
+| Invite user | Admin, owner | Invite-only: a manager invites an **e-mail** with the `admin` or `employee` role (never `owner`) — the address is never checked against existing accounts. The invitee gets a queued e-mail, signs in (or registers) with that address and **accepts or declines**; membership exists only after acceptance. Invites expire after 7 days; an e-mail that is already a member or already has a pending invite is rejected (an expired invite may be replaced); at most 10 invites per hour per manager and entity. Managers can cancel pending invites. |
 | Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
-| Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
+| Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. Done explicitly ("save role") from the member detail modal; the owner membership is immutable and the last manager cannot be demoted. |
+| Members page | Admin, owner | Employees get 403 on the members page. Removal asks for confirmation in a modal. |
 
 ## Queue and Tickets
 
